SUSPECTED BUG: Header calls io.ReadAtLeast on a local *strings.Reader and
returns nil for err == io.EOF. Expected exactly 2 entries: io.ErrUnexpectedEOF and
io.ErrShortBuffer ((*strings.Reader).Read only returns io.EOF, which is filtered here or
turned into ErrUnexpectedEOF). io.EOF is correctly absent, but actual output also lists
the (*os.File).Read errors (os.ErrInvalid, os.ErrClosed, internal/poll and syscall
values): Candidates of r.Read inside io.ReadAtLeast come from another caller (Peek ->
Magic -> io.ReadFull with an *os.File), although the argument here is a freshly built
*strings.Reader (no narrowing at substitution, plan P08/S09).
